Cell[BoxData["\<\"Found 250 zero sectors out of 1024.\\n    \
ZeroSectors[threeLoopWindow] \[LongDash] zero sectors,\\n    \
NonZeroSectors[threeLoopWindow] \[LongDash] nonzero sectors,\\n    \
SimpleSectors[threeLoopWindow] \[LongDash] simple sectors (no nonzero \
subsectors),\\n    BasisSectors[threeLoopWindow] \[LongDash] basis sectors \
(at least one immediate subsector is zero),\\n    ZerojRule[threeLoopWindow] \
\[LongDash] a rule to nullify all zero j[threeLoopWindow\[Ellipsis]],\\n    \
CutDs[threeLoopWindow] \[LongDash] a flag list of cut denominatorsj \
(1=cut).\"\>"], "Print",
